# The slash popup lists the skills a query finds after its commands
# (prepareSlashMenu, picker_presentation.zig:1100-1124; slashMenuRowContent,
# :1240-1266): name, description, short source, under `Results N`. Tab and
# Enter on a skill row bind its token (bindSelectedSlashSkill,
# app_input_runtime.zig:2895-2919).
fx: work skills-ws-fx
xfx: work skills-ws-xfx
wait 3
type /
wait 0.8
snap slash-all
key Up
wait 0.5
snap slash-all-up
key C-u
wait 0.3
type /de
wait 0.8
snap slash-de
type m
wait 0.8
snap slash-dem
key Tab
wait 0.5
snap slash-dem-tab
key C-u
wait 0.3
type /re
wait 0.8
snap slash-re
type l
wait 0.8
snap slash-rel
key Enter
wait 0.8
snap rel-enter
